Most worlds along the [[Infinite Horizon]] are copies of [[Færrin]] as it would have been without people: empty, and much like the world beside them. A Joker World is one that breaks the pattern. No two are alike, and no one has found why they differ. The gods are asked and do not answer.

A Joker World shows a magical presence where the empty worlds show none. Some are wrapped in slip-shielding, and a traveler who tries to slip into one is turned back at its edge.
